Otavue Extensions

themes/gigaviewer.js, themes/comici.js, themes/madara.js and their sites/*.json lists are ported
from Keiyoushi's extensions (https://github.com/keiyoushi/extensions-source:
lib-multisrc/gigaviewer, lib-multisrc/comiciviewer, lib-multisrc/madara and the sources built on them), licensed under the Apache License 2.0,
which in turn continue the Tachiyomi and Mihon projects' extensions.

themes/mangadex.js is written from MangaDex's public API documentation
(https://api.mangadex.org/docs/).
